The original Verilog RTL sources (Verilog/*.v, with the exception of
interface modifications described below) are licensed under the
Apache License 2.0. See the LICENSE file for the full terms.

Modifications by this project:
  - The top-level module interface was changed from an `inout [31:0]
    data` bidirectional bus to a split interface (`data_in`,
    `data_out`, `data_oe`) to enable safe flattening under Yosys.
  - A complete signoff flow (synthesis, place & route, DRC, LVS,
    static timing analysis, power/IR-drop analysis) was added under
    the flow/ directory.

